tem: Scrap pistol drawn. Hold right mouse to aim.\nWarden Ossa: Clean work. Bring that servo to the field fabricator at my post; a steadier grip will tame that pistol. The rest of the salvage sells at Basic General.\nField Pack: Collected: Damaged Servo \u00d71, Scrap Alloy \u00d72, Nanite Residue \u00d71 Schematic discovered: Stabilised Pistol Grip.","bounds":[42,361,368,694],"fontSize":18.0,"classes":["unity-label","unity-text-element"]},{"name":"unity-slider","type":"ScrollerSlider","visible":true,"enabled":true,"text":null,"bounds":[416,943,24,49],"fontSize":18.0,"classes":["unity-base-slider--vertical","unity-base-field","unity-base-slider","unity-scroller__slider","unity-slider","unity-base-field--no-label"]},{"name":"unity-drag-container","type":"VisualElement","visible":true,"enabled":true,"text":null,"bounds":[416,943,24,49],"fontSize":18.0,"classes":["unity-base-slider__drag-container"]},{"name":"unity-tracker","type":"VisualElement","visible":true,"enabled":true,"text":null,"bounds":[416,943,24,49],"fontSize":18.0,"classes":["unity-base-slider__tracker"]},{"name":"unity-dragger","type":"VisualElement","visible":true,"enabled":true,"text":null,"bounds":[419,982,18,7],"fontSize":18.0,"classes":["unity-base-slider__dragger"]},{"name":"chat-footer","type":"VisualElement","visible":true,"enabled":true,"text":null,"bounds":[42,1021,386,27],"fontSize":18.0,"classes":["chat-footer"]},{"name":"","type":"Label","visible":true,"enabled":true,"text":"Local transmissions","bounds":[73,1032,116,15],"fontSize":16.0,"classes":["unity-label","unity-text-element","muted","small"]},{"name":"quickbar","type":"VisualElement","visible":true,"enabled":true,"text":null,"bounds":[616,970,688,90],"fontSize":18.0,"classes":["movable-window"]},{"name":"hotbar","type":"VisualElement","visible":true,"enabled":true,"text":null,"bounds":[616,970,688,90],"fontSize":18.0,"classes":["panel"]},{"name":"slot1","type":"Button","visible":true,"enabled":true,"text":"","bounds":[629,988,64,64],"